  abstract    = "The intersection of AI and biology has entered a phase of
                 explosive growth, driven by the ambition to build ``Virtual
                 Cells'' or computational models capable of predicting cellular
                 responses to any perturbation. Following the success of
                 structural biology (e.g., AlphaFold) and large language models,
