  abstract  = "Single-cell RNA sequencing quantifies biological samples at an
               unprecedented scale, allowing us to decipher biological
               differentiation dynamics such as normal development or disease
               progression. As conventional single-cell RNA sequencing
               experiments are destructive by nature, reconstructing cellular
